      "3. Compounding Record (Master Formulation Record) vs Dispensing: In USP <825>, compounding is governed by a monograph. When compounding an 8 mCi kit, the compounder is instructed to add 8 mCi of precursor into the kit, not 8.33 mCi. Overfilling a kit without a physician's prescription specifying an overfill is a deviation."
